      "num_comments": 10,
      "num_likes": 126,
      "num_shares": 5,
      "post_text": "Shipped this week: brand kits now hold three reference ads, not just fonts and colours. Paste two ads you already like and every render matches their pacing. Small feature, and it cut our own revision rounds roughly in half.",
