      "num_comments": 59,
      "num_likes": 488,
      "num_shares": 20,
      "post_text": "Unpopular opinion from a video tool: your ads are not underperforming because the creative is bad. They are underperforming because you shipped two of them. Two ads is not a test, it is a coin flip with a budget attached.",
      "post_type": "post",
