      "id": "7241000000000000003",
      "num_comments": 147,
      "num_likes": 1180,
      "num_shares": 42,
      "post_text": "Nine hooks that kept winning across 4,000 ads our customers shipped this year. Swipe through \u2014 9 slides, one hook each, with the ad that proved it and the number it moved. Slide 6 is the one nobody believes until they run it.",
      "post_type": "document",
