      "id": "7241000000000000012",
      "num_comments": 16,
      "num_likes": 164,
      "num_shares": 8,
      "post_text": "Shipped: search your footage by what was said. Type a phrase, get every clip where someone said it, with the timeline already cut. Built it for ourselves and then realised nobody should have to scrub an hour of Zoom recording again.",
      "post_type": "post",
      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/clipwise_activity-7241000000000000012",
      "user_followers": 9600,
      "user_id": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/clipwise"
    },
    "source_id": "7241000000000000012"
  },
  {
    "payload": {
      "_competitor_ref": "clipwise.io",
      "date_posted": "2026-09-02T10:45:00.000Z",
      "hashtags": [
        "#clipwise",
