      "id": "7241000000000000010",
      "num_comments": 84,
      "num_likes": 874,
      "num_shares": 33,
      "post_text": "Three edits every winning ad shares. Swipe \u2192 6 slides: hook inside the first second, captions that carry the sound off, a cut every three seconds, and the two we thought mattered but did not. Slide 5 is the one that surprised us.",
      "post_type": "document",
      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/clipwise_activity-7241000000000000010",
      "user_followers": 9600,
      "user_id": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/clipwise"
