      "id": "7241000000000000018",
      "num_comments": 59,
      "num_likes": 417,
      "num_shares": 20,
      "post_text": "Stop sanding the edges. In our spend test the variants that won had an unsteady first second, a real room behind the presenter, and a line that sounded thought of rather than read. Polish is what viewers flag as artificial.",
      "post_type": "post",
      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/avatarly_activity-7241000000000000018",
      "user_followers": 12700,
      "user_id": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/avatarly"
