      "id": "7241000000000000017",
      "num_comments": 94,
      "num_likes": 1042,
      "num_shares": 44,
      "post_text": "Ten things we learned filming 200 licensed presenters. Swipe \u2192 10 slides on casting for range instead of looks, why the sceptic outperforms the enthusiast, and the lighting mistake that made our first forty faces unusable.",
      "post_type": "document",
      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/avatarly_activity-7241000000000000017",
      "user_followers": 12700,
      "user_id": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/avatarly"
    },
