      ],
      "id": "7241000000000000016",
      "num_comments": 38,
      "num_likes": 358,
      "num_shares": 11,
      "post_text": "Every presenter in our library signed a per-use agreement and can withdraw a face at any time. We publish the withdrawn count every quarter. It has been non-zero twice, and we think both numbers should be public.",
      "post_type": "post",
      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/avatarly_activity-7241000000000000016",
      "user_followers": 12700,
      "user_id": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/avatarly"
    },
    "source_id": "7241000000000000016"
  },
  {
    "payload": {
      "_competitor_ref": "avatarly.com",
      "date_posted": "2026-08-18T13:00:00.000Z",
      "hashtags": [
        "#avatarly",
        "#ugc"
      ],
      "id": "7241000000000000015",
      "num_comments": 114,
      "num_likes": 925,
      "num_shares": 41,
      "post_text": "We showed ten ads to 2,000 people. One was made by a human crew, nine by Avatarly. 14% picked the human one \u2014 worse than chance. People do not detect synthesis, they detect polish, and they read polish as fake.",
      "post_type": "post",
      "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/avatarly_activity-7241000000000000015",
      "user_followers": 12700,
      "user_id": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/avatarly"
    },
    "source_id": "7241000000000000015"
  },
  {
    "payload": {
      "_competitor_ref": "avatarly.com",
      "date_posted": "2026-08-04T11:20:00.000Z",
      "hashtags": [
        "#avatarly",
